":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DC\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["RESULT\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["20\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Ossus is home to a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"}," known as the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ysanna"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ysanna?action=edit&redlink=1"},". They are remnants of the ancient Jedi civilization that lived on the world before ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Great Sith War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Great_Sith_War"},".\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["25\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ysanna"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ysanna?action=edit&redlink=1"}," have a particularly strong connection to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},".\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Galactic Lore"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DC\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["RESULT\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["20\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Ossus, once a desolate and unforgiving world, was ravaged during ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Great Sith War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Great_Sith_War"}," by the destruction of the Cron Cluster. The planet was reinvigorated by Kol Skywalker's Ossus Project. Thanks to the terraforming efforts of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yuuzhan Vong"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong","referenceId":"reference:93079e2f7d73d480"}," Shapers, Ossus is now a lush planet covered in forests.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["25\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Ossus was home to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}," until Darth Krayt's Empire wiped out the temple there. The ruins of the Jedi Temple remain, and rumor has it these ruins are filled with artifacts of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi Order"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi_Order"},".\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["30\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["The planet's greatest city, Knossa, still stands (albeit in ruins) despite the ravages of time. Many locals inhabit the ruins, attempting to restore the city to its once great status.\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Social Sciences"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DC\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["RESULT\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["15\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["The only native ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"}," on Ossus are the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ysanna"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ysanna?action=edit&redlink=1"},", a race of nomadic ",{"tag":"a","children":["Near-Humans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Near-Humans"}," who wander the deserts to survive.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["20\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Some ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ysanna"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ysanna?action=edit&redlink=1"}," believe that they can wield magic, and they use their magic to help their people endure the planet's harsh climate. ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}," believe that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ysanna"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ysanna?action=edit&redlink=1"}," magic is tied to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},".\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["25\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ysanna"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ysanna?action=edit&redlink=1"}," are survivors of the supernova that ravaged the planet several millennia ago. They are the descendants of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}," who inhabited the Great Library when the shock wave hit the planet.\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["The Great Library of Ossus"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Great Library of Ossus reportedly holds the largest repository of knowledge the galaxy has ever known. Its appearance is said to have inspired the design of the Jedi Temple on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Coruscant"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Coruscant","referenceId":"reference:2ee37a21e9e7a955"},", with its ziggurat-style base and four spires that surmount each corner of the structure. The library contains information relating to every field of study, contained in numerous forms ranging from reader tapes and holographic media to ancient books and paper scrolls. All documents are carefully preserved within the library's archives.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Beneath the library proper lies the Chamber of Antiques, an area with many different vaults to store the most valuable artifacts from worlds and cultures all across the galaxy. Within these chambers also lie ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Holocrons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Holocrons"}," and other Dark Side relics recovered from those who used them for their own dark purposes. Access to these items is understandably restricted.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["During its height, the Great Library of Ossus sees many non-Jedi using the facility for research into a variety of subjects. Republic personnel involved in the war against ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith_Empire","referenceId":"reference:303e4cc32aa1a8e1"}," are sent to Ossus to aid in its defense.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Adventure Hooks"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Adventure and excitement accompany ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi Order"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi_Order"}," wherever it goes. Since ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi Order"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi_Order"}," maintains only one key temple at a time, adventure ideas should be easy to focus and implement, depending on the era of your campaign.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["A viral outbreak has created a pandemic within the population of a heavily populated planet in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Outer Rim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Outer_Rim?action=edit&redlink=1"},", and knowledge of the cure is believed to be held within one of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Holocrons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Holocrons","referenceId":"reference:78fdd3622bfea307"}," stored in the Chamber of Antiquities at the Great Library of Ossus. The heroes must race against time to Ossus and obtain the cure from the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Holocron"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Holocron"},". However, they soon learn that someone has removed it from its rightful place."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["News of an attack on the Great Library of Ossus reaches the heroes, and they take steps to thwart the attack or warn ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}," before the assault happens."]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
